  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There's a new feature coming to Servers and Users, which is the new \"Server Following\" feature for Discord, already seems available for a variety of other games!\n\n- With Server Following, you can now have automated posts  with news about VRChat delivered directly to your server in a channel of your choice, using Webhooks!\n\n(Server Following FAQ): https://support.discordapp.com/hc/en-us/articles/360028384531-Server-Following-FAQ\n\nSo users can simply press follow on a channel that is marked as \"news\" and set the channel they want to send the chat messages to, this might be neat for people that want to get the #announcements and #server-status over to their Discord Servers.\n---------\nNote: The Follow button is only available in News channels, labeled with the newspaper icon! Developers can learn how to make a News channel: https://support-dev.discordapp.com/hc/en-us/articles/360027891611-Sell-Your-Game-on-Discord-How-to-do-it",
